request.description:
This endpoint allows the user to verify client bank details.

### Request Body

- updateAction (string): This must be VerifyBankDetails

- updateReason (string): The reason for the update.
- updateData (object): The object containing the updated client data.

    - bankDetails (object): The bank details to be verified.

        - sortCode (string): The sort code of the bank.
        - accountNumber (string): The bank account number.


### Response

The response will be an empty "data" object

Example

Request:

``` json
{
  "updateAction": "VerifyBankDetails",
  "updateReason": "exampleReason",
  "updateData": {
    "bankDetails": {
      "sortCode": "123456",
      "accountNumber": "78901234"
    }
  }
}

 ```

Response:

```
{
  "data": {}
}

 ```

