item.description:
An adviser fee structure can be assigned to a client fee group to share the same fee setup across all clients in the group. When a fee event is triggered, the group's combined portfolio value is used for any percentage-tier calculation in the structure, while any flat £ fee in the structure is applied per account.

The adviser fee structure is set on the group's `intentDetails.feeStructures.adviserFeeId` property:

``` json
"intentDetails": {
  "feeStructures": {
    "adviserFeeId": "fee-structure-id"
  }
}

 ```

