item.description:
### JISA Graduation

Seccl automatically transitions JISAs into adult ISAs once a client turns 18 as per [HMRC regulation.](https://www.gov.uk/junior-individual-savings-accounts/manage-an-account#:~:text=When%20your%20child%20turns%2018,when%20the%20child%20turns%2018.) This documentation provides details on flows and how to utilise the relevant API endpoints for your platform.

#### Endpoints

``` json
/client
/clientProduct
/account

```

#### How does the API handle a JISA graduation?

1. Daily scheduler checks for individual minors turning 18
2. This triggers a process which removes the legal guardian `parentId` as the decision maker and makes a series of updates to the JISA `client`, `clientProduct` and `account` records shown below:


###### Updates to the JISA graduate `client`

#### **Changed attributes**

These changes to the record are captured under `updateHistory` for a the new Adult ISA client record.

---

`status` string  
Active to Registered

---

`clientType` string  
Individual Minor to Individual

---

`parentId` string  
Removed from new Adult client record

---

`jisaGraduate` boolean  
Only found on client records which have graduated from JISA to Adult ISA

---

`version` number  
Updated version of client record from 1 to 2

``` json
{
    "data": {
        "id": "02HDDGF",
        "firmId": "SECCL",
        "nodeId": [
            "0"
        ],
        "status": "Registered",
        "clientType": "Individual",
        "dateOfBirth": "2005-06-12T00:00:00.000Z",
        "firstName": "Pebbles",
        "surname": "Flintstone",
        "taxDomicile": "GB",
        "currency": "GBP",
        "nationality": "GB",
        "addressDetail": {
            "flatNumber": "Bedrock",
            "address1": "The Cave Road",
            "country": "GB",
            "postCode": "BE1 R0K"
        },
        "email": "newgrad@example.com",
        "updateId": "6486e8e55d5d7722d0252bf4",
        "updateHistory": [
            {
                "updateId": 1,
                "updateDate": "2023-06-12T09:44:05.240Z",
                "updateData": {
                    "fromData": {
                        "clientType": "Individual Minor"
                    },
                    "toData": {
                        "clientType": "Individual"
                    }
                },
                "updatedFields": [
                    "clientType"
                ]
            },
            {
                "updateId": 2,
                "updateDate": "2023-06-12T09:44:05.241Z",
                "updateData": {
                    "fromData": {
                        "parentId": [
                            "02HDDDF"
                        ]
                    }
                },
                "updatedFields": [
                    "parentId"
                ]
            },
            {
                "updateId": 3,
                "updateDate": "2023-06-12T09:44:05.241Z",
                "updateData": {
                    "toData": {
                        "jisaGraduate": true
                    }
                },
                "updatedFields": [
                    "jisaGraduate"
                ]
            },
            {
                "updateId": 4,
                "updateDate": "2023-06-12T09:44:05.241Z",
                "updateData": {
                    "fromData": {
                        "status": "Active"
                    },
                    "toData": {
                        "status": "Registered"
                    }
                },
                "updatedFields": [
                    "status"
                ]
            }
        ],
        "jisaGraduate": true,
        "_surname": "FLINTSTONE",
        "_firstName": "PEBBLES",
        "auditDetails": {
            "updateDate": "2023-06-12T09:44:05.246Z",
            "userFirmId": "BACKGROUND",
            "userId": "Background",
            "version": 2,
            "application": "client-data-manager-client-event-service"
        },
        "amlData": {
            "checkNode": [],
            "checks": [],
            "checkResult": "UNCHECKED"
        },
        "externalIds": []
    }
}

```

###### The JISA client product `clientProduct`

#### **Changed attributes**

These changes to the record are captured under `updateHistory` for a the new Adult ISA clientProduct record

---

`clientIds` string  
Only holds the graduate adult ISA `clientId`. `parentId` is removed

---

`wrapperType` string  
JISA to ISA

---

`declarationAcceptanceDate` string  
Removed from graduate adult client record

---

``` javascript
{
    "data": {
        "id": "6486e7074d2c3060398c801a",
        "clientIds": [
            "02HDDDG"
        ],
        "firmId": "SECCI",
        "nodeId": "0",
        "wrapperType": "ISA",
        "updateId": "6486e8e55d5d7722d0252bf9",
        "auditDetails": {
            "updateDate": "2023-06-12T09:44:05.764Z",
            "userFirmId": "BACKGROUND",
            "userId": "Background",
            "version": 3,
            "application": "client-data-manager-client-event-service"
        }
    }
}

```

###### JISA accounts `account`

#### **Changed attributes**

These changes to the record are captured under `updateHistory` for the new Adult ISA account record

---

`status` string  
Active to Pending

---

`clientId` string  
Removes the `parentId` and only holds graduate clientId

---

`wrapperDetail.jisaGraduationDate` date  
The date which the client graduated from JISA to ISA in YYYY-MM-DDT00:00:00.000+00:00 format

---

`wrapperDetail.wrapperType` string  
From JISA to ISA

---

``` json
{
    "data": {
        "id": "02DC236",
        "firmId": "SECCI",
        "nodeId": "0",
        "status": "Pending",
        "name": "JISA grad tester",
        "currency": "GBP",
        "accountType": "Wrapper",
        "wrapperDetail": {
            "wrapperType": "ISA",
            "discretionary": false,
            "advised": true,
            "assetAllocationId": "0244F",
            "clientProductId": "6486e7074d2c3060398c801a",
            "jisaGraduationDate": "2023-06-12T00:00:00.000Z",
            "assetAllocationName": "Cucumber"
        },
        "clientName": "Pebbles Flintstone",
        "updateId": "6486e8e55d5d7722d0252bfa",
        "clientId": "02HDDDG",
        "updateHistory": [
            {
                "updateId": 1,
                "updateDate": "2023-06-12T09:44:05.694Z",
                "updateData": {
                    "toData": {
                        "clientId": "02HDDDG"
                    }
                },
                "updatedFields": [
                    "clientId"
                ]
            },
            {
                "updateId": 2,
                "updateDate": "2023-06-12T09:44:05.694Z",
                "updateData": {
                    "fromData": {
                        "wrapperDetail": {
                            "wrapperType": "JISA",
                            "discretionary": false,
                            "advised": true,
                            "assetAllocationId": "0244F",
                            "clientProductId": "6486e7074d2c3060398c801a"
                        }
                    },
                    "toData": {
                        "wrapperDetail": {
                            "wrapperType": "ISA",
                            "discretionary": false,
                            "advised": true,
                            "assetAllocationId": "0244F",
                            "clientProductId": "6486e7074d2c3060398c801a",
                            "jisaGraduationDate": "2023-06-12T00:00:00.000Z"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "updatedFields": [
                    "wrapperDetail.wrapperType"
                ]
            },
            {
                "updateId": 3,
                "updateDate": "2023-06-12T09:44:05.695Z",
                "updateData": {
                    "fromData": {
                        "status": "Active"
                    },
                    "toData": {
                        "status": "Pending"
                    }
                },
                "updatedFields": [
                    "status"
                ]
            }
        ],
        "_name": "JISA grad tester",
        "auditDetails": {
            "updateDate": "2023-06-12T09:44:05.940Z",
            "userFirmId": "BACKGROUND",
            "userId": "Background",
            "version": 2,
            "application": "client-data-manager-client-event-service"
        }
    }
}

```

#### After graduation

- Graduating JISAs will transition to an adult Individual Savings Account (ISA) on the platform and can continue to use the account by completing the usual client registration process (see either "PUT - Update registered client to active" in the "Create client" section for a single step process or the "Update a client" section for multi-stage processes where clients accept terms separatly to data being provided)
- Clients choosing to leave the platform can withdraw all assets or transfer to a different provider. To withdraw, following appropriate AML checks, bank account details must be provided for the client. Clients wishing to withdraw within 90 days of graduation will not be subject to suspicious transaction checks due to adding the new bank account details.


#### Subscription allowance

Graduated JISA clients with contributions up to £9000 made in the tax year they graduate will see an updated ISA allowance for the remainder of the tax year (£20,000) inclusive of their JISA contributions, should they continue on the platform as an ISA client.

---

For more information on ISAs, please view the _Individual Savings_ _Account_ section

