request.description:
The client webhook fires upon a client being created or updated.

You can use the below PATCH request to [https://pfolio-api-staging.seccl.tech/webhook/config/client/.](https://pfolio-api-staging.seccl.tech/webhook/config/client/.) This will set up your client webhook URL and secret:

``` json
{
    "url": "your-webhook.url",
    "secret": "your-associated-secret"
}

 ```

The format of the data posted by the client webhook upon client creation will be as follows:

``` json
{
  "events": [{
    "clientId": "000043J",  // ID of the client
    "data": {{client}}, // new client data
    "firmId": "{{firmId}}",  // firm of the client
    "updateDate": "2019-05-04T10:06:31.047Z" // date of client creation
  }]
}

 ```

The `data` property will contain the entire `client` entity that has been created.

The format of the data posted by the client webhook upon client update will be as follows:

``` json
{
  "events": [{
    "clientId": "000043J",  // ID of the client
    "updateFields": ["updatedField"], // name of the updated fields
    "updateData": {{updatedField: "data"}}, // the data the client is being updated with
    "firmId": "{{firmId}}",  // firm of the client
    "updateDate": "2019-05-04T10:06:31.047Z" // date of the update
  }]
}

 ```

To validate the message, we will include a header field called `webhook-signature`. The data will be a hash of the body data sent above. This will be a HMAC SHA256 hash.

The message webhook is fired upon a message being sent to a client.

You can use the below PATCH request to [https://pfolio-api-staging.seccl.tech/webhook/config/message/.](https://pfolio-api-staging.seccl.tech/webhook/config/message/.) This will set up your message webhook URL and secret:

``` json
{
    "url": "your-webhook.url",
    "secret": "your-associated-secret"
}

 ```

The format of the data posted by the message webhook upon message creation will be as follows:

``` json
{
  "events": [{
        "messageType": "NEW_ACCOUNT",
        "clientId": "{{clientId}}",
        "firmId": "SECCI",
        "updateDate": "2025-01-21T16:38:16.266Z",
        "type": "NEW_ACCOUNT", // the message type
        "message": {
            "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
            "MESSAGE_BODY": "Congratulations, you have set up a new account!",
            "MESSAGE_SUBJECT": "Your New Account"
        }
    }
}

 ```

To validate the message, we will include a header field called `webhook-signature`. The data will be a hash of the body data sent above. This will be a HMAC SHA256 hash.
